---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

const PLAY_STORE_URL =
  "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bluetechtg.dieverlorenenwoerter";
---

<Legal
  frontmatter={{
    title: "Die verlorenen Wörter",
    project: "Die verlorenen Wörter",
    published: "September 18, 2026",
    updated: "November 9, 2026",
    description: "Die verlorenen Wörter — Learn German through play, an interactive narrative adventure in Nebelstein.",
  }}
>
  <Fragment slot="hero">
    <div class="hero">
      <img class="icon" src={`${base}dieverlorenenwoerter/icon.png`} alt="" width="88" height="88" />
      <p class="tagline">Learn German through play: a narrative adventure in Nebelstein.</p>
      <div class="badges">
        <a href={PLAY_STORE_URL} aria-label="Available on Google Play">
          <img src={`${base}dieverlorenenwoerter/google-badge.png`} alt="Available on Google Play" height="44" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <p>
    Nebelstein has been struck by the Silence: its inhabitants have lost their words. In Die
    verlorenen Wörter, you are the messenger tasked with restoring them, one by one — learning real
    German along the way.
  </p>
  <p>
    No repetitive quiz drills: each word you restore advances the storyline, unlocks a character,
    or opens up a new location.
  </p>

  <h2>A Story, Not a Textbook</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A complete narrative journey (Arc 1, 10 chapters) with characters who remember your choices.</li>
    <li>Otto, Mira, Jonas, Herr Falk: each character assists you with unique teaching dynamics.</li>
    <li>Your relationships with characters grow and unlock bonus story chapters.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Learn by Playing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Guess words from contextual clues and images (4 images, 1 word).</li>
    <li>Complete fill-in-the-blank dialogues, listen to voice recordings, and solve mysteries.</li>
    <li>Dialogue choice challenges to speak with the right character at the right moment.</li>
    <li>Unscramble broken sentences and practice real grammar patterns.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The Wörterbuch</h2>
  <p>Every word you learn is reinforced using spaced repetition so it stays in your memory permanently.</p>

  <h2>Play Anywhere</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Works offline: progress synchronizes smoothly whenever connectivity is restored.</li>
    <li>Continue your adventure across multiple devices.</li>
    <li>Optional daily reminders to keep up your momentum.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    The first arc, "Ankunft", is completely free from start to finish. Geared for A1 level
    beginners in German.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    <a href={`${base}dieverlorenenwoerter/privacy/`}>Privacy Policy</a> · <a href={`${base}dieverlorenenwoerter/terms/`}>Terms of Service</a> · Contact:&nbsp;
    bluetechtg@gmail.com
  </p>
</Legal>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .icon {
    border-radius: 22%;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);
  }

  .tagline {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 40ch;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .badges img {
    display: block;
    height: 44px;
    width: auto;
  }
</style>
